  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>,</p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So by using the relation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we will solve the given equation&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2022</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2022</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2021</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2020</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1011</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1012</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2022</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>1</mn></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2021</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>1</mn></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2020</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>1</mn></munder><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1011</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1012</mn><mn>2023</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>1</mn></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>1011</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>times</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1011</mn></math></p>"
